    "Floty": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {},
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "Floty beenden": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit Floty"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Floty merkt sich, was du kopierst, und legt es lokal ab. Als verborgen markierte Inhalte aus Passwortmanagern werden nie aufgenommen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Floty remembers what you copy and keeps it on this Mac. Items marked as concealed by password managers are never recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Floty öffnen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Floty"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Floty-Einstellungen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Floty Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gilt nur, solange das Panel nicht festgepinnt ist.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only applies while the panel is not pinned."
          }
        }
      }
    },
